commit 28fbe4f132a500e64ee5b00130c751950a9f16aa
Author: s-smits <sjssmits@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Aug 27 12:13:42 2025 +0000

    Fix multi-host TPU synchronization issues in GRPO/GSPO
    
    - Made generation seeds deterministic across hosts (removed process_index dependency)
    - Gated alignment check to single-host to avoid device op divergence
    - Removed debug prints that could cause host divergence
    - Added strategic barriers around critical transitions
    - Fixed indentation in seed generation block
    - Created safe test configuration for stability testing
    
    Addresses 'unexpected peer with different launch id' TPU errors by ensuring
    all hosts execute identical operations in lockstep.

